    <guid isPermaLink="false">67555f9ebdb9877a97314728</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Dec 2024 09:19:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a></span></strong><br><span>主播小雨介绍节目主题，邀请光姐作为嘉宾，讨论她的转职经历和人生观。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a></span></strong><br><span>光姐自我介绍，回顾自己的职业生涯，从设计师到高校老师，再到西门子家电的营销管理工作，工作了十年。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a></span></strong><br><span>光姐谈到辞职的原因，强调不想被公司淘汰，选择在职业生涯的巅峰时刻主动辞职。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a></span></strong><br><span>光姐描述辞职后的生活，进行了一年多的国内外旅行，享受自由。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a></span></strong><br><span>与其他嘉宾的经历对比，光姐认为辞职的原因与健康问题不同，她选择的是主动寻求变化。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a></span></strong><br><span>光姐谈到辞职时对家庭经济的考虑，表示自己对职业技能的信心，相信会有机会。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a></span></strong><br><span>光姐分享了辞职后的探索过程，最终决定学习心理咨询，并开设了自己的咨询工作室。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a></span></strong><br><span>讨论心理咨询的职业特点和市场需求，光姐认为这是一个自由且有意义的工作。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a></span></strong><br><span>光姐谈到如何获得客户，强调口碑和人际关系的重要性。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a></span></strong><br><span>光姐分享了自己的工作室运营情况，谈到稳定性和收入波动的挑战。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a></span></strong><br><span>光姐探讨了爱好的重要性，鼓励观众不断尝试新事物，寻找自己的兴趣。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a></span></strong><br><span>讨论天赋与赚钱的关系，光姐认为每个人都有天赋，但很多人未能发现。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a></span></strong><br><span>光姐分享了对家庭教育的看法，强调让孩子快乐成长的重要性。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a></span></strong><br><span>最后，光姐展望未来，计划在五十岁时举办特别的退休仪式，庆祝人生的新阶段。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">62:00</a></span></strong><br><span>主播小雨总结访谈内容，鼓励观众关注自己的兴趣与人生选择。</span></p><span></span><p><span>光姐的视频号和公众号“光姐的江湖”，分享她去世界各地旅游的风景</span></p>]]></description>
